1
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:01,500
{\an8}[alarm blaring]

2
00:01:03,500 --> 00:01:05,840
REYES: ORION, status report. What
just hit us?

3
00:01:07,840 --> 00:01:11,500
ORION: Micrometeoroid swarm, Captain.
Hull breach in the oxygen bay.

4
00:01:14,500 --> 00:01:17,860
KAI: Oxygen reserves are dropping.
We've got maybe six hours.

5
00:01:19,860 --> 00:01:22,680
REYES: Then we have six hours to
fix it. Kai, suit up.

6
00:01:25,680 --> 00:01:29,340
KAI: Captain, the swarm is still
out there. If I go outside now...

7
00:01:31,340 --> 00:01:33,500
REYES: I know the risk. I'm going with you.

8
00:01:42,500 --> 00:01:44,000
[breathing heavily]

9
00:01:46,000 --> 00:01:49,120
KAI: I see the breach. It's bigger
than ORION calculated.

10
00:01:51,120 --> 00:01:55,200
ORION: Recalculating. Probability
of successful repair: thirty-one percent.

11
00:01:58,200 --> 00:02:01,020
REYES: I've never cared much for
probabilities, ORION.

12
00:02:04,020 --> 00:02:06,780
KAI: The patch won't hold! The
seal keeps cracking!

13
00:02:08,780 --> 00:02:12,440
REYES: Use the heat shield panel
from the cargo bay. Cut it to size.

14
00:02:15,440 --> 00:02:18,020
KAI: That panel is our only shield
for re-entry.

15
00:02:20,020 --> 00:02:22,720
REYES: We can't re-enter if we
can't breathe. Do it.

16
00:02:32,720 --> 00:02:34,220
[metal clanging]

17
00:02:36,220 --> 00:02:38,680
ORION: Breach sealed. Oxygen levels
stabilizing.

18
00:02:40,680 --> 00:02:42,480
KAI: We did it. We actually did it.

19
00:02:45,480 --> 00:02:49,440
REYES: We're not done yet. Without
that shield, we need another way home.

20
00:02:52,440 --> 00:02:57,240
ORION: Captain, there is a derelict
station four hundred kilometers away. The Meridian.

21
00:02:59,240 --> 00:03:02,300
REYES: Set a course for the Meridian.
Everybody gets home.

22
00:03:05,300 --> 00:03:06,800
KAI: You always say that.

23
00:03:08,800 --> 00:03:10,300
REYES: And I've always meant it.

24
00:03:12,300 --> 00:03:15,300
